he’s going to burp even as she gags.\n (Some of the soap solution that’s come back up leaks out a little, and the bubbles in her mouth puff up)\n・Reaching the limit of endurance, I let out a massive burp toward the soap bubble, spewing bubbles from my mouth with a gurgling sound, while my private parts continue to produce bubbles that fill the inside, making lewd \"brrr-brrr\" sounds in sync with the burp.\n・The lingering sensation triggers massive incontinence, filling the soap bubble with urine. Inside the bubble, the mixture of the bubbles she produced, the air from her private parts’ farts, and the lingering echo of her burp creates a scene too gruesome to behold.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15abOJg269HeFsSBletsFQze8jcyIBqRz?usp=drive_link", "nc": 185, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@514chankawaii/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7cccb5c4/uploads/origins/7b435ad5-6abd-4a70-b66e-6816add33984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a80ee978033ac1cedf0dfce9d24500f9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7cccb5c4/uploads/origins/7b435ad5-6abd-4a70-b66e-6816add33984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a80ee978033ac1cedf0dfce9d24500f9, https://si.imgix.net/7cccb5c4/uploads/origins/7b435ad5-6abd-4a70-b66e-6816add33984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bc0af2868f074d5968de344824c2a99f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7cccb5c4/uploads/origins/7b435ad5-6abd-4a70-b66e-6816add33984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&t