h=200&blur=200&s=9695548f7f3e12d23afb7ef198914f67 3x"}, "body": "(Please excuse the resending of this message due to an alteration in the requested text.)\nGood evening, Dr. Shigu. I always look at your wonderful illustrations. Your illustrations for the Winter Comic Book were wonderful...Thank you very much for your help ().\n\nI would like to ask for an illustration of Nico of the Blue Archive who has food poisoning and is excreting soft stool in a Japanese-style toilet. I would also like to ask for a depiction of vomiting.  (https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/131022217) I would like you to depict him as if he is vigorously excreting solid stool or soft stool like in this illustration of Aoba. Also, I would like you to make him OB around the toilet bowl with flamboyance and make the toilet bowl look messy.\n\nThe illustration of Kanoe in the food poisoning book of this winter's Comiket really stuck in my mind, so I would like to have the same angle of view and pose. Please depict a transparent depiction in the toilet bowl so that we can see what has accumulated in the toilet bowl as well as in that illustration.\n\nAlso, if possible\n (1) The figure of a person who is taking out a solid stool.\n2) Soft stools are being discharged vigorously after the solid stools have been discharged.\n(3) The figure vomiting while holding his mouth while emitting soft stool.\nIf you can't do it, it's OK. If it's too much, it's OK.\n\nIf the amount is not enough or not your guess, you can cancel or resend it. Thank you very much for your consideration.", "nc": 171, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@514chankawaii/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1096935, "client_id": 2386093, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e41be1fcce86e76c7038bc37f3e6b5a2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e41be1fcce86e76c7038bc37f3e6b5a2, https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22069bd39a5edbf732efc0aaf3acc372 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b973dfeef9a28a9857a7a1f32061e62e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6221d6312a4b6b49ced9a0ba9065e3ef", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6221d6312a4b6b49ced9a0ba9065e3ef, https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c429504992ca0f28bb0b026d14924264 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bd05cf56/uploads/origins/b8ca55de-af66-46ca-b18a-9a1d10d6d619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=52826e51a6b8a0ea4a8a22d0e6de605e 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして、しぐさん。いつもイラスト見ています\n天童アリス(ブルーアーカイブ)の着衣脱糞絵を以下の指定でお願いします！\n\n【衣装】\nメイド服\n\n【ポーズ】\nスカートをたくし上げてうんこ座りの体勢でしゃがみこんでいて、背を向けてはいるが顔はこちらの方を振り向いてじっとこちらを見つめている\n\n【下着】\n白と水色のしましまぱんつ(便の重さでお尻が少し見えちゃってるとすごく嬉しいです)\n\n【排泄物】\nhttps://second-fitness.com/benpikikan/\nこのサイトのタイプ2のような硬い大便で下着をモッコリ膨らませていて、小便が床に広がっている(大便は床に落ちておらず、全部下着の中にみっちり詰まっている)\n\n【シチュエーション】\n先生に頼まれてシャーレでこっそり見せてあげているような感じでお願いします\n\nそして、ここからは無視していただいてもかまわないのですが\n\n・1つのイラストの中にコマを複数描いていただけるのであれば、1コマ目に先生にお願いされるアリス(このコマではアリスは制服のまま)、2コマ目に上述の着衣脱糞イラスト、3コマ目に下着の中の漏らした大便をこちらに見せ、顔を少し赤くしてニンマリと微笑みを浮かべながら上目遣いでこちらを見つめるアリス\nをお願いしたいです\n\n・絆ランク100のマークと、乾電池の入った箱を絵のどこかに描いていただきたいです\n\n\n注文が多くなってしまい申し訳ありませんが、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします\n(もし難しい箇所があれば多少変更やアレンジしていただいて結構です)\n\nhttps://second-fitness.com/benpikikan/", "nc": 186, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@514chankawaii/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1096935, "client_id": 1539627, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd3ae1ee7f0e86913d67e85a114ce3d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd3ae1ee7f0e86913d67e85a114ce3d6, https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=497158f6cff2f31e034f3e96817854f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=377eadf5cddb9ce3c8e028944286cc04 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=50968c6e970d4af0c6096eeaeb0d08ca", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=50968c6e970d4af0c6096eeaeb0d08ca, https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1210654838f1b231dbd7a5887719c725 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eba2b3f7/uploads/origins/94be5d24-886e-4ec1-8d66-789657e69259?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eeda4d96b09ef870ee3ce881ad5a555c 3x"}, "body": "しぐ先生はじめまして。リクエストさせていただきます！\nブルーアーカイブの歌住サクラコがお腹を下していて女子トイレに行くが故障や使用禁止で使えず、我慢出来ずに男子トイレの洋式で下痢をしているのを描いてください。\n便器内は透過するものをお願いいたします。それとその男子トイレはシャーレの先生がカメラを仕掛けて盗撮している感じのものをおまけで描いていただけたら嬉しいです。セリフ等は先生のおまかせで、服装は通常衣装で構図は資料URLにあります。よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/77878913", "nc": 58, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 6351, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "🐳かげつき🐳", "screen_name": "2010Psy_chic", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1375431507230171137/NHswiR6m.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/751089781/1778169407/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 63889, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "魂神💗3rd単行本『異種愛HEART』発売中！", "screen_name": "konkonshin", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1943957547548884992/vN_ivuNv.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/526907249/1739543404/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 40}, {"i